  "body": "Discover contemporary living at 74 Ara Taha Crescent, Orewa - a stylish, low-maintenance home offering comfort, space and modern features in a sought-after location.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n* Brand NEW\r\n* 3 spacious bedrooms\r\n* 2 well-appointed bathrooms\r\n* Impressive raft ceiling design with high ceilings, creating a bright and spacious feel\r\n* Modern open-plan living, dining and kitchen\r\n* Central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n* 236sqm (more or less) easy-care section\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern lifestyles in mind, the high ceilings add a wonderful sense of openness and light, while the central air conditioning ensures comfort throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, a smart investment or a lock-up-and-leave property, this home offers an appealing combination of style, functionality and convenience.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your opportunity to make 74 Ara Taha Crescent your new home - enquire today!\r\n\r\nHow to find 74 Ara Taha Cres:\r\nGPS to Mahinga Kai Road, Orewa, and follow the red arrow on the map in the photos to find 74 Ara Tahah Cres. Or simply give us a call so we can direct you to the property.",
